        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana RCA336, Solid Brass Roller Catch</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThese solid brass roller catches have an adjustable height and tension. The rolller catch is adjusted with a thumb turn wheel. Roller catches can be installed in the top, bottom, or side edge of doors to hold them closed. Packaged with matching finish mounting screws and T-strike plate.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/deltana-RCA336-size.gif?v=1704354683\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana RCA336 Roller Catch Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available:  \r\n<a href=\"/products/heavy-duty-brass-roller-catch-deltana-rca430\"><b>Heavy Duty Roller Catches</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana RCA336 Roller Catch:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length: 2-1/4\" </li>\r\n<li>Width: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/RCA336.pdf?v=1691095375\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana RCA336 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Solid Brass Adjustable Roller Catch",
                "description": "Solid Brass Roller Catch, Deltana RCA336 - These solid brass roller catches have an adjustable height and tension. The rolller catch is adjusted with a thumb turn wheel. Roller catches can be installed in the top, bottom, or side edge of doors to hold them closed. Packaged with matching finish mounting screws and T-strike plate. Available in 9 different finishes.",
